Grammar

    0 $accept: expression_list $end

    1 expression_list: expression SEMICOLON
    2                | expression_list expression SEMICOLON

    3 expression: NUMBER
    4           | IDENTIFIER
    5           | '(' expression ')'
    6           | IDENTIFIER '(' ')'
    7           | IDENTIFIER '(' args ')'
    8           | expression '+' expression
    9           | expression '-' expression
   10           | expression '*' expression
   11           | expression '/' expression
   12           | expression '%' expression
   13           | '-' expression
   14           | '+' expression
   15           | expression FDIV expression
   16           | expression INCREMENT
   17           | expression DECREMENT
   18           | expression '^' expression
   19           | expression LAND expression
   20           | expression LOR expression
   21           | LNOT expression
   22           | expression EQ expression
   23           | expression NEQ expression
   24           | expression LT expression
   25           | expression LTE expression
   26           | expression GT expression
   27           | expression GTE expression
   28           | expression BITAND expression
   29           | expression BITOR expression
   30           | expression BITXOR expression
   31           | expression LSHIFT expression
   32           | expression RSHIFT expression
   33           | BNOT expression
   34           | IDENTIFIER '=' expression

   35 args: expression
   36     | args ',' expression


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    '%' (37) 12
    '(' (40) 5 6 7
    ')' (41) 5 6 7
    '*' (42) 10
    '+' (43) 8 14
    ',' (44) 36
    '-' (45) 9 13
    '/' (47) 11
    '=' (61) 34
    '^' (94) 18
    error (256)
    NUMBER <node> (258) 3
    IDENTIFIER <node> (259) 4 6 7 34
    SEMICOLON (260) 1 2
    LOR (261) 20
    LAND (262) 19
    BITOR (263) 29
    BITXOR (264) 30
    BITAND (265) 28
    EQ (266) 22
    NEQ (267) 23
